// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (same folder) and fill in your real
// value. Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored — Xcode reads it as the app
// target's base configuration and substitutes GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID into
// Info.plist at build time (see GoogleClientID key), so nothing here ever
// needs to live in GoogleCalendarService.swift or get committed.
//
// Get this from Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials →
// your OAuth client ID (type: iOS). See README.md section 1.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID = YOUR_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
